第一条 定义 / Article 1 Definitions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1.1 “本软件”指由授权方提供的 SpineView 应用程序、可执行文件、安装包、更新、
    升级、文档，以及随附的授权信息。
    “The Software” means the SpineView application, executable files, installation
    packages, updates, upgrades and documentation provided by the Licensor, together
    with any accompanying License Information.

1.2 “授权方”指本软件的著作权人 zhang chen。
    “The Licensor” means zhang chen, the copyright owner of the Software.

1.3 “你”指通过订单合法取得本软件授权，并依据本协议使用本软件的自然人、法人或
    非法人组织。如你代表组织接受本协议，你声明并保证已获得该组织的充分授权。
    “You” means the natural person, legal entity or unincorporated organization that
    has lawfully obtained a license to the Software under an Order and uses the
    Software under this Agreement. If you accept this Agreement on behalf of an
    organization, you represent and warrant that you are duly authorized to do so.

1.4 “订单”指购买或续费时授权方确认的订单、发票、电子邮件或其他书面记录，载明
    授权类型、期限、席位数量、价格、更新与支持范围等商业条款。
    “Order” means the order, invoice, email or other written record confirmed by the
    Licensor at the time of purchase or renewal, setting out the license type, term,
    number of Seats, price, update and support scope and other commercial terms.

1.5 “设备”指安装、激活或运行本软件的计算机或其他终端。
    “Device” means a computer or other terminal on which the Software is installed,
    activated or run.

1.6 “席位”指订单许可的自然人用户数量。除订单另有明确约定外，一个席位对应一名
    自然人用户，每个席位可在订单或渠道包载明的设备台数内同时激活本软件。
    “Seat” means the number of natural-person users licensed under an Order. Unless
    the Order expressly provides otherwise, one Seat corresponds to one natural
    person, and each Seat may have the Software activated on the number of Devices
    stated in the Order or the channel package at the same time.

1.7 “更新”指授权方在同一主版本内发布的修正、修补或小幅改进；“升级”指主版本
    变更或授权方另行标识的版本。
    “Update” means a correction, patch or minor improvement released by the Licensor
    within the same major version; “Upgrade” means a new major version or a release
    otherwise designated as an upgrade by the Licensor.

1.8 “授权信息”指授权方提供的许可证、授权码、激活令牌、设备绑定信息，以及用于
    验证本软件授权状态的其他标识或数据。
    “License Information” means the license, license key, activation token,
    device-binding information and other identifiers or data provided by the Licensor
    to verify the licensed status of the Software.

