第二条 协议的接受、适用与版本 / Article 2 Acceptance, Scope and Version
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

2.1 你安装、复制、激活或以其他方式使用本软件，即表示你接受本协议。如你不同意
    本协议，不得使用本软件。
    By installing, copying, activating or otherwise using the Software, you accept
    this Agreement. If you do not agree to this Agreement, you must not use the
    Software.

2.2 本协议适用于生效日之后交付的版本。在本协议生效前，依据当时适用的授权协议
    合法取得的版本，继续适用其取得时的协议；当你安装或使用本协议适用的版本时，
    本协议适用于该版本。
    This Agreement applies to versions delivered on or after the Effective Date.
    Versions lawfully obtained before the Effective Date under the license agreement
    then in force remain governed by that agreement; when you install or use a version
    to which this Agreement applies, this Agreement governs that version.

2.3 订单与本协议不一致的，以订单条款为准。订单未约定的事项，适用本协议。
    If an Order conflicts with this Agreement, the Order prevails. Matters not
    addressed in an Order are governed by this Agreement.

2.4 未支付相应费用或未取得有效授权的，你无权使用本软件。本协议仅授予订单明确
    约定的授权。
    You have no right to use the Software unless you have paid the applicable fees
    and obtained a valid license. This Agreement grants only the license expressly set
    out in an Order.

2.5 本协议不排除、不限制你依据适用法律享有的不可放弃的权利。
    This Agreement does not exclude or limit any rights you have under applicable law
    that cannot be waived.

