第三条 授权授予 / Article 3 License Grant
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

3.1 在你支付相应费用并持续遵守本协议及订单的前提下，授权方授予你一项有限的、
    非独占的、不可转让、不可再许可、可依本协议终止的许可，允许你按照本协议和
    订单使用本软件。
    Subject to your payment of the applicable fees and your continued compliance with
    this Agreement and the Order, the Licensor grants you a limited, non-exclusive,
    non-transferable, non-sublicensable and terminable license to use the Software in
    accordance with this Agreement and the Order.

3.2 在上述范围内，你可以：
    (a) 在订单约定的授权期限内，按订单载明的席位，每个席位可在订单或渠道包载明
        的设备台数内安装、激活并运行本软件；同一席位同时激活的设备不得超过该
        台数，订单另有明确约定的除外；
    (b) 仅为备份目的复制本软件的可执行文件和文档，但不得复制、共享或分发
        授权信息；
    (c) 将本软件用于你的个人或商业项目。
    Within that scope, you may:
    (a) install, activate and run the Software during the term set out in the Order,
        for the Seats set out in the Order, on the number of Devices per Seat stated
        in the Order or the channel package; no more Devices than that number may be
        activated at the same time for one Seat unless the Order expressly provides
        otherwise;
    (b) copy the Software's executable files and documentation solely for backup
        purposes, but must not copy, share or distribute License Information;
    (c) use the Software for your personal or commercial projects.

3.3 组织使用：如你为组织，每个席位仅限一名指定自然人使用。多名人员需要使用本
    软件的，应取得相应数量的席位。你不得在人员之间轮换或共享同一席位，以规避
    席位数量限制。
    Organizational use: If you are an organization, each Seat is limited to one
    designated natural person. If multiple individuals need to use the Software, you
    must obtain the corresponding number of Seats. You may not rotate or share a Seat
    among individuals to circumvent the Seat limit.

3.4 本协议仅授予使用许可，不授予源代码、著作权、商标权或其他任何未明确授予的
    权利。本软件以目标代码形式提供。
    This Agreement grants only a license to use the Software. It grants no source
    code, copyright, trademark or other rights not expressly granted. The Software is
    provided in object-code form only.

3.5 授权按席位整体授予，不得拆分、按设备转售或以其他方式单独转让。
    A license is granted as a whole per Seat and may not be split, resold per Device
    or otherwise transferred separately.

3.6 本软件仅通过授权方指定的渠道交付。授权方仅对通过官方渠道获得的版本提供支持
    和服务；通过非官方渠道获得的版本不在授权方支持范围内。
    The Software is delivered only through channels designated by the Licensor. The
    Licensor provides support and services only for versions obtained through official
    channels; versions obtained through unofficial channels are outside the Licensor's
    support scope.

