第四条 授权类型与期限 / Article 4 License Types and Term
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

4.1 按年订阅授权：期限自订单载明之日起算，时长以订单为准。订阅期限届满且未
    续费的，授权终止，本软件将停止提供全部或部分功能；订单另有约定的除外。
    Annual subscription: The term starts on the date stated in the Order, and its
    duration is set out in the Order. If the subscription expires and is not renewed,
    the license terminates and the Software will stop providing all or part of its
    functionality, unless the Order provides otherwise.

4.2 终身授权：在订单载明的范围内永久使用本软件。终身授权包含的更新、升级和技术
    支持范围以订单为准；订单未约定的，终身授权适用于购买时对应的版本，未来的
    升级按届时订单另行提供。
    Lifetime license: You may use the Software permanently within the scope stated in
    the Order. The scope of Updates, Upgrades and technical support included in a
    lifetime license is set out in the Order; if the Order is silent, the lifetime
    license applies to the version corresponding to your purchase, and future Upgrades
    are provided under a separate Order at that time.

4.3 授权期限、席位数量、设备数量以订单和授权信息为准。授权期限届满、授权被
    吊销或本协议终止后，本软件将停止提供相应授权功能；这是授权机制的组成部分。
    经授权方同意续期或另行授权后，你可以继续使用。
    The license term, number of Seats and number of Devices are determined by the
    Order and the License Information. Upon expiry of the term, revocation of the
    license or termination of this Agreement, the Software will stop providing the
    corresponding licensed functionality as part of the licensing mechanism. You may
    continue using it after the Licensor agrees to a renewal or grants a separate
    license.

4.4 续费按续费时的订单和价格执行。除非续费时另有说明，续费不改变本协议。
    Renewals are subject to the Order and pricing in effect at the time of renewal.
    Unless otherwise stated at renewal, a renewal does not change this Agreement.

