第五条 激活、设备绑定与授权管理 / Article 5 Activation, Device Binding and License Administration
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

5.1 本软件通过在线激活和授权验证确认授权状态。激活时校验设备标识，并将授权编号、
    设备标识信息（如设备标识的哈希）、激活时间和授权状态发送至授权服务。
    The Software confirms its licensed status through online activation and license
    verification. Activation checks Device identifiers and sends the license number,
    Device identifier information (such as a hash of the Device identifier), activation
    time and license status to the licensing service.

5.2 每个席位最多可在两（2）台设备上同时激活。当你在第三台设备上激活时，系统
    将自动释放该席位下最久未使用的一台设备；你也可以在「关于 SpineView」中退出
    本机授权，立即释放本机名额。
    Each Seat may be activated on no more than two (2) Devices at the same time. When
    you activate a third Device, the system will automatically release the least
    recently used Device under that Seat. You may also log out the current Device from
    “About SpineView” to release the seat immediately.

5.3 因更换设备、重装系统或其他原因需要重新激活的，可按授权说明操作或联系授权方
    申请重置。授权方有权要求你提供购买凭证，并可对重置次数作出合理限制。
    If reactivation is needed due to a Device change, operating system reinstallation
    or other reasons, you may follow the license instructions or contact the Licensor
    for a reset. The Licensor may require proof of purchase and may reasonably limit
    the number of resets.

5.4 激活后，你可以在授权期限内离线使用本软件。连续离线超过授权服务设定的期限
    （默认为三十（30）天）时，本软件需要联网重新验证；未通过验证的，可能停止
    提供全部或部分功能。
    After activation, you may use the Software offline during the license term. If
    the Software remains offline for more than the period set by the licensing service
    (thirty (30) days by default), it must reconnect to revalidate; if revalidation
    fails, the Software may stop providing all or part of its functionality.

5.5 除授权验证、在线状态同步和接收授权方通知外，本软件不进行其他网络通信。在线
    期间，本软件与授权服务保持连接，仅用于授权验证、在线设备计数和接收与授权、
    服务或安全有关的通知。本软件不上传你的动画文件或项目内容，不包含遥测、
    行为分析、远程控制或后台上传功能。
    The Software makes no network communications other than license verification,
    online status synchronization and receiving notices from the Licensor. While
    online, the Software maintains a connection to the licensing service solely for
    license verification, online Device counting and receiving notices relating to
    licensing, service or security. The Software does not upload your animation files
    or project content and contains no telemetry, behavioral analytics, remote control
    or background upload functionality.

5.6 授权信息可能包含购买者信息、授权类型、期限、设备指纹和数字签名。你应妥善
    保管授权信息，不得修改、伪造、复制、共享、公开传播或允许他人使用。
    License Information may contain purchaser information, license type, term, Device
    fingerprint and digital signature. You must keep License Information secure and
    must not modify, forge, copy, share, publicly distribute or permit others to use
    it.

5.7 授权方可以通过授权服务向你发送与授权、服务或安全有关的通知，本软件将以窗口
    形式显示。该等通知仅用于信息告知，授权范围以本协议和订单为准。
    The Licensor may send you notices relating to licensing, service or security
    through the licensing service, which the Software will display in a window. Such
    notices are informational only; the scope of your license is governed by this
    Agreement and the Order.

5.8 因你保管不当或违反本协议导致授权信息被他人使用、泄露或盗用的，你应承担
    相应责任。发现授权信息遗失、被盗或泄露的，应立即通知授权方。
    You are responsible for any use, disclosure or misappropriation of License
    Information caused by your failure to keep it secure or by your breach of this
    Agreement. If you discover that License Information has been lost, stolen or
    disclosed, you must notify the Licensor immediately.

5.9 授权方可以改进授权验证和授权管理方式，但不会追溯性地缩短你已支付费用的授权
    期限，也不会减少订单已授予的席位或设备数量。
    The Licensor may improve its license verification and administration methods, but
    will not retroactively shorten the license term you have paid for or reduce the
    number of Seats or Devices granted by the Order.

