第六条 限制 / Article 6 Restrictions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

6.1 你不得复制、发布、上传、分发、出售、出租、出借、转售、共享或以其他方式向
    任何第三方提供本软件、安装包或授权信息，但本协议明确允许的备份复制除外。
    You must not copy, publish, upload, distribute, sell, rent, lend, resell, share
    or otherwise make available the Software, installation packages or License
    Information to any third party, except for backup copies expressly permitted by
    this Agreement.

6.2 你不得绕过、删除、修改、禁用或以其他方式干扰本软件的授权验证、激活、期限
    控制、设备绑定、水印、版权声明或其他权利管理机制。
    You must not circumvent, remove, modify, disable or otherwise interfere with the
    Software's license verification, activation, term control, Device binding,
    watermark, copyright notices or other rights-management mechanisms.

6.3 你不得对本软件进行反向工程、反编译、反汇编，或试图获取其源代码，除非适用
    法律明确允许且该等权利不能通过合同排除。
    You must not reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the Software, or attempt
    to obtain its source code, unless applicable law expressly permits it and the
    right cannot be excluded by contract.

6.4 你不得修改、删除或隐藏本软件中的版权声明、商标、许可声明或第三方声明。
    You must not modify, remove or conceal any copyright notice, trademark, license
    notice or third-party notice in the Software.

6.5 你不得将本软件或其任何部分用于制作、传播或协助制作破解版本、盗版复制品、
    规避授权机制的工具或教程，也不得为上述目的提供技术支持或服务。
    You must not use the Software or any part of it to create, distribute or assist in
    creating cracked versions, pirated copies, or tools or tutorials that circumvent
    licensing mechanisms, and must not provide technical support or services for those
    purposes.

6.6 除非订单或授权方的书面许可明确允许，你不得将本软件作为服务提供给第三方，
    包括但不限于租赁、托管、外包、代操作、按次收费或共享授权信息等方式。
    Unless expressly permitted by an Order or the Licensor's written consent, you
    must not provide the Software to third parties as a service, including by rental,
    hosting, outsourcing, operating on behalf of others, charging per use or sharing
    License Information.

6.7 你不得将本软件用于违反适用法律、法规或第三方权利的活动。
    You must not use the Software for activities that violate applicable laws,
    regulations or third-party rights.

6.8 你不得将本软件用于干扰他人计算机系统或网络的行为，也不得利用本软件实施危害
    网络安全的活动。
    You must not use the Software to interfere with the computer systems or networks
    of others, or to engage in activities that endanger cybersecurity.

